{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:173ce69580c2c6a2","name":"Rocket Jumper Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-173ce69580c2c6a2","title":"Rocket Jumper Talent Tree","revision":19311,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:42:50Z","sha256":"55d67c24b2e2e3374b24915de6caa2a3628e561aa8d87296b4da6f72d0bf724a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19311","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Rocket%20Jumper%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-173ce69580c2c6a2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are an expert in the use of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Packs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Packs"},". You can use this form of transport to perform specialized aerial assaults and maneuvers.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Jet Pack Training"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can activate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Pack","referenceId":"reference:a59ece57b04d9594"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," on your turn. You need not make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks to land safely with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Pack","referenceId":"reference:a59ece57b04d9594"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Burning Assault"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Jet Pack Training"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," you can expend one of your Jet Pack's charges to make an attack with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Pack","referenceId":"reference:a59ece57b04d9594"},", treating it as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flamethrower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flamethrower","referenceId":"reference:3c07f870ddf7e92b"},". You cannot use this Talent when you are flying. You are considered proficient in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flamethrower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flamethrower","referenceId":"reference:3c07f870ddf7e92b"}," for purposes of making this attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Trajectory"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Jet Pack Training"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You always use the proper trajectories to maximize the efficiency of your rocket-pack burn rates. You increase your fly speed by 2 squares when using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Pack","referenceId":"reference:a59ece57b04d9594"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Jet Pack Withdraw"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Jet Pack Training"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," when an opponent moves adjacent to you, you can expend one charge of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Pack","referenceId":"reference:a59ece57b04d9594"}," to fly and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Withdraw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Withdraw","referenceId":"reference:164546a9c5481480"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
